{
  "path": "/appendix/group-guide/understand-scope",
  "title": "역할이 닿는 범위 이해하기",
  "desc": "같은 역할이라도 어느 그룹에서 주느냐에 따라 닿는 범위가 달라진다",
  "toc": [
    {
      "id": "권한은-어느-그룹에서-줬는가에-매입니다",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "권한은 \"어느 그룹에서 줬는가\"에 매입니다"
    },
    {
      "id": "조직-범위와-그룹-범위",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "조직 범위와 그룹 범위"
    },
    {
      "id": "세팅할-때-정하는-순서",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "세팅할 때 정하는 순서"
    },
    {
      "id": "알아두면-좋은-것",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "알아두면 좋은 것"
    }
  ],
  "html": "<p>이 가이드는 <strong>조직을 처음 세팅하는 사람</strong>을 위한 것입니다.\n누구에게 무엇을 열어 줄지 정하기 전에, <strong>권한이 어디까지 미치는지</strong>부터 알아야 합니다.</p>\n<p>각 화면의 버튼이 무엇을 하는지는 <a href=\"#/detail/organization/role-permissions\">역할·권한 구성</a> 문서를 보세요.\n여기서는 <strong>왜 그렇게 나뉘어 있고, 우리 조직은 어떻게 정해야 하는지</strong>를 다룹니다.</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"권한은-어느-그룹에서-줬는가에-매입니다\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#권한은-어느-그룹에서-줬는가에-매입니다\" class=\"peer\">권한은 &quot;어느 그룹에서 줬는가&quot;에 매입니다</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>역할 이름만 보면 안 됩니다. <strong>같은 이름의 역할이라도 어느 그룹에서 부여했느냐에 따라 닿는 범위가 다릅니다.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"py-6\"><p class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground mb-1 leading-relaxed\">같은 그룹 트리에서 역할을 <strong class=\"text-fd-foreground font-medium\">한 곳에만</strong> <!-- -->부여했을 때, 그 역할이 <strong class=\"text-fd-foreground font-medium\">어느 그룹까지 닿는지</strong> <!-- -->비교한 것입니다.</p><p class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground mb-4\"><span class=\"inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-400 align-middle mr-1\"></span>색이 채워진 그룹 = 닿음  ·  흐리고 취소선 = 닿지 않음  · <!-- --> <strong class=\"text-fd-foreground\">부여</strong> 표시 = 역할을 준 자리</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"px-3.5 pt-3.5 pb-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-violet-600 text-white dark:bg-violet-500\">조직 관리자</span><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground mt-1.5\">최상위 그룹(회사)에서 부여</div></div><div class=\"mx-3.5 mb-3 bg-fd-muted rounded-lg px-2 py-2.5 flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:0px\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-violet-50 text-violet-900 border-violet-400 dark:bg-violet-950 dark:text-violet-100 dark:border-violet-600\">회사</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-violet-600 text-white dark:bg-violet-500\">부여</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:12px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">├</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-violet-50 text-violet-900 border-violet-400 dark:bg-violet-950 dark:text-violet-100 dark:border-violet-600\">개발본부</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:24px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">├</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-violet-50 text-violet-900 border-violet-400 dark:bg-violet-950 dark:text-violet-100 dark:border-violet-600\">플랫폼팀</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:24px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">└</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-violet-50 text-violet-900 border-violet-400 dark:bg-violet-950 dark:text-violet-100 dark:border-violet-600\">데이터팀</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:12px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">└</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-violet-50 text-violet-900 border-violet-400 dark:bg-violet-950 dark:text-violet-100 dark:border-violet-600\">영업본부</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-stretch gap-2 px-3.5 pb-3.5\"><span class=\"w-1 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-violet-400 dark:bg-violet-600\"></span><div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">5<!-- -->개 그룹에 닿음</div><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug mt-0.5\">모든 그룹에 닿습니다</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"px-3.5 pt-3.5 pb-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-600 text-white dark:bg-emerald-500\">그룹 관리자</span><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground mt-1.5\">개발본부에서 부여</div></div><div class=\"mx-3.5 mb-3 bg-fd-muted rounded-lg px-2 py-2.5 flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:0px\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium border-slate-200 text-slate-400 line-through decoration-slate-300 opacity-60 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-600 dark:decoration-slate-700\">회사</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:12px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">├</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-900 border-emerald-400 dark:bg-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-100 dark:border-emerald-600\">개발본부</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-600 text-white dark:bg-emerald-500\">부여</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:24px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">├</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-900 border-emerald-400 dark:bg-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-100 dark:border-emerald-600\">플랫폼팀</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:24px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">└</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-900 border-emerald-400 dark:bg-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-100 dark:border-emerald-600\">데이터팀</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:12px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">└</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium border-slate-200 text-slate-400 line-through decoration-slate-300 opacity-60 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-600 dark:decoration-slate-700\">영업본부</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-stretch gap-2 px-3.5 pb-3.5\"><span class=\"w-1 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-emerald-400 dark:bg-emerald-600\"></span><div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300\">3<!-- -->개 그룹에 닿음</div><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug mt-0.5\">본인 그룹 + 하위 전부. 형제인 영업본부에는 닿지 않습니다</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"px-3.5 pt-3.5 pb-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-amber-500 text-white dark:bg-amber-500\">그룹원</span><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground mt-1.5\">플랫폼팀에서 부여</div></div><div class=\"mx-3.5 mb-3 bg-fd-muted rounded-lg px-2 py-2.5 flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:0px\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium border-slate-200 text-slate-400 line-through decoration-slate-300 opacity-60 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-600 dark:decoration-slate-700\">회사</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:12px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">├</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium border-slate-200 text-slate-400 line-through decoration-slate-300 opacity-60 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-600 dark:decoration-slate-700\">개발본부</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:24px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">├</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-amber-50 text-amber-900 border-amber-400 dark:bg-amber-950 dark:text-amber-100 dark:border-amber-600\">플랫폼팀</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500 text-white dark:bg-amber-500\">부여</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:24px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">└</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium border-slate-200 text-slate-400 line-through decoration-slate-300 opacity-60 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-600 dark:decoration-slate-700\">데이터팀</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:12px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">└</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium border-slate-200 text-slate-400 line-through decoration-slate-300 opacity-60 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-600 dark:decoration-slate-700\">영업본부</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-stretch gap-2 px-3.5 pb-3.5\"><span class=\"w-1 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-amber-400 dark:bg-amber-600\"></span><div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300\">1<!-- -->개 그룹에 닿음</div><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug mt-0.5\">본인 그룹만. 아래로 내려가지 않습니다</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-3.5 border border-dashed border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 bg-fd-muted\"><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground mb-1\">외울 것은 한 줄</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-fd-foreground\">아래로 내려가는 역할은<!-- --> <span class=\"text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300\">그룹 관리자</span>뿐입니다. 옆으로는 아무도 가지 않습니다.</div></div></div>\n<p>가장 자주 헷갈리는 지점은 <strong>형제 그룹</strong>입니다.\n개발본부의 그룹 관리자는 그 아래 플랫폼팀·데이터팀까지 관리하지만, <strong>영업본부에는 손댈 수 없습니다.</strong>\n조직도에서 옆으로는 닿지 않고, 아래로만 닿습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><strong>&quot;저 사람 그룹 관리자인데 왜 이 그룹 멤버를 못 옮기죠?&quot;</strong>\n대개 이 때문입니다. 관리해야 하는 그룹에서 직접 역할을 받아야 합니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"조직-범위와-그룹-범위\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#조직-범위와-그룹-범위\" class=\"peer\">조직 범위와 그룹 범위</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>권한 하나하나에도 <strong>어느 층에서 쓰이는지</strong>가 정해져 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"py-6\"><p class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed\">두 범위의 차이는<!-- --> <strong class=\"text-fd-foreground font-medium\">그 권한을 실제로 썼을 때 누가 영향을 받는가</strong> <!-- -->입니다.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-violet-600 dark:bg-violet-700 px-3.5 py-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-white\">조직 범위 권한</span></div><div class=\"px-3.5 pt-3 pb-1\"><div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-fd-foreground\">공지사항 하나를 올리면</div></div><div class=\"mx-3.5 my-2 bg-fd-muted rounded-lg px-2 py-2.5 flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:0px\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-violet-100 text-violet-900 border-violet-400 dark:bg-violet-900 dark:text-violet-50 dark:border-violet-600\">회사</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">영향</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:12px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">├</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-violet-100 text-violet-900 border-violet-400 dark:bg-violet-900 dark:text-violet-50 dark:border-violet-600\">개발본부</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">영향</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:24px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">├</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-violet-100 text-violet-900 border-violet-400 dark:bg-violet-900 dark:text-violet-50 dark:border-violet-600\">플랫폼팀</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">영향</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:24px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">└</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-violet-100 text-violet-900 border-violet-400 dark:bg-violet-900 dark:text-violet-50 dark:border-violet-600\">데이터팀</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">영향</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:12px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">└</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-violet-100 text-violet-900 border-violet-400 dark:bg-violet-900 dark:text-violet-50 dark:border-violet-600\">영업본부</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">영향</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-stretch gap-2 px-3.5 pb-2\"><span class=\"w-1 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-violet-500\"></span><div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">전 직원이 봅니다</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug mt-0.5\">행사한 결과가 회사 전체에 닿습니다</div></div></div><div class=\"mx-3.5 mb-3.5 rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 border-violet-300 bg-violet-50 dark:border-violet-700 dark:bg-violet-950/40\"><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-foreground leading-snug\">그래서 최상위 그룹에서만 부여할 수 있습니다</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-slate-500 dark:bg-slate-700 px-3.5 py-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-white\">그룹 범위 권한</span></div><div class=\"px-3.5 pt-3 pb-1\"><div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-fd-foreground\">플랫폼팀에 멤버를 초대하면</div></div><div class=\"mx-3.5 my-2 bg-fd-muted rounded-lg px-2 py-2.5 flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:0px\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium border-slate-200 text-slate-400 opacity-50 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-600\">회사</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:12px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">├</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium border-slate-200 text-slate-400 opacity-50 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-600\">개발본부</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:24px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">├</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium bg-slate-200 text-slate-900 border-slate-400 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-50 dark:border-slate-500\">플랫폼팀</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">영향</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:24px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">└</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium border-slate-200 text-slate-400 opacity-50 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-600\">데이터팀</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" style=\"padding-left:12px\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 select-none leading-none\">└</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border font-medium border-slate-200 text-slate-400 opacity-50 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-600\">영업본부</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-stretch gap-2 px-3.5 pb-2\"><span class=\"w-1 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-slate-400\"></span><div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">그 팀에만 반영됩니다</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug mt-0.5\">행사한 결과가 그 그룹을 넘지 않습니다</div></div></div><div class=\"mx-3.5 mb-3.5 rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 border-slate-200 bg-fd-muted dark:border-slate-700\"><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-foreground leading-snug\">그래서 어느 그룹에서나 부여할 수 있습니다</div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-3.5 border border-dashed border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 bg-fd-muted\"><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground mb-1\">부여 위치를 나눠 둔 이유</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-fd-foreground\">하위 팀장이 회사 전체에 닿는 권한을 스스로 만들 수 있다면 조직 통제가 무너집니다. 그래서 <span class=\"text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">조직 범위 권한</span>은 최상위 그룹으로 묶어 두었습니다.</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>범위</th><th>어디서 부여할 수 있나</th><th>어떤 것들인가</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>그룹 범위</strong></td><td>모든 그룹에서</td><td>멤버 관리, 그룹 AI 모델 키, RAG 스페이스·데이터, 워크스페이스·플레이그라운드</td></tr><tr><td><strong>조직 범위</strong></td><td><strong>최상위 그룹에서만</strong></td><td>모델 카탈로그·정책, 모델서빙, 계정·감사, 전사 챗봇, 공지사항, 전역 연결, 전사 마스킹</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-warning, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><strong>하위 그룹에서는 조직 범위 권한이 목록에 아예 나타나지 않습니다.</strong>\n회색으로 비활성화되는 것이 아니라 보이지 않습니다.</p><p>찾던 권한이 안 보인다면 <strong>내 그룹 관리 탭에서 최상위 그룹을 선택한 뒤</strong> 다시 확인하세요.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"세팅할-때-정하는-순서\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#세팅할-때-정하는-순서\" class=\"peer\">세팅할 때 정하는 순서</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>조직을 처음 세팅한다면 아래 순서로 정하는 편이 헤매지 않습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"py-6\"><p class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed\">각 단계에서 <strong class=\"text-fd-foreground font-medium\">실제로 무엇을 정하는지</strong> <!-- -->입니다. 뒤 단계는 앞 단계 위에 얹히므로 순서를 바꾸면 다시 손봐야 합니다.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border-2 border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 p-3.5 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-slate-600 text-white dark:bg-slate-500\">1</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-fd-foreground\">그룹 구조</span></div><div class=\"text-xs font-medium mb-2.5 leading-snug text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">우리 회사를 어떤 단위로 나눌까?</div><div class=\"bg-fd-muted rounded-lg px-2.5 py-2 mb-2.5\"><div class=\"text-[10px] text-fd-muted-foreground mb-1\">예를 들면</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-foreground leading-relaxed\">개발본부 › 플랫폼팀 · 데이터팀</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-foreground leading-relaxed\">영업본부 › 국내영업팀</div></div><div class=\"mt-auto\"><div class=\"text-[11px] font-medium mb-1 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">⚠ <!-- -->한 번 정하면 바꾸기 번거롭습니다</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug\">조직도가 곧 권한이 닿는 범위가 됩니다</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border-2 border-violet-300 dark:border-violet-700 p-3.5 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-violet-600 text-white dark:bg-violet-500\">2</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-fd-foreground\">그룹원 기본선</span></div><div class=\"text-xs font-medium mb-2.5 leading-snug text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">아무 역할이 없는 사람은 어디까지 할 수 있게 할까?</div><div class=\"bg-fd-muted rounded-lg px-2.5 py-2 mb-2.5\"><div class=\"text-[10px] text-fd-muted-foreground mb-1\">예를 들면</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-foreground leading-relaxed\">관리까지 맡길까, 일만 하게 할까?</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-foreground leading-relaxed\">AI 모델 키를 직접 등록하게?</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-foreground leading-relaxed\">아니면 보기만 하게?</div></div><div class=\"mt-auto\"><div class=\"text-[11px] font-medium mb-1 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">⚠ <!-- -->모든 그룹에 한 번에 적용됩니다</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug\">여기서 연 권한은 조직의 모든 사람이 갖게 됩니다</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border-2 border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-700 p-3.5 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-emerald-600 text-white dark:bg-emerald-500\">3</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-fd-foreground\">커스텀 역할</span></div><div class=\"text-xs font-medium mb-2.5 leading-snug text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300\">기본선 위에 담당자에게만 무엇을 더 열어줄까?</div><div class=\"bg-fd-muted rounded-lg px-2.5 py-2 mb-2.5\"><div class=\"text-[10px] text-fd-muted-foreground mb-1\">예를 들면</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-foreground leading-relaxed\">전사 챗봇 공개 담당자</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-foreground leading-relaxed\">계정 관리 담당자</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-foreground leading-relaxed\">팀 멤버 운영 담당자</div></div><div class=\"mt-auto\"><div class=\"text-[11px] font-medium mb-1 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">↺ <!-- -->사람마다 붙였다 뗐다 할 수 있습니다</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-fd-muted-foreground leading-snug\">2번이 정해진 뒤에 얹는 것이라 3번이 마지막입니다</div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-3.5 border border-dashed border-violet-300 dark:border-violet-700 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-950/40\"><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground mb-1\">순서를 지켜야 하는 이유</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-fd-foreground\"><span class=\"text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\">2번(그룹원 기본선)</span>에서 연 권한은 <strong>조직의 모든 사람이 갖게 됩니다.</strong> 3번에서 역할을 아무리 잘게 나눠도, 이미 전원에게 열어 둔 권한은 되돌릴 수 없습니다.</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>자세히 읽을 곳</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1 · 그룹 구조</td><td><a href=\"#/detail/organization/manage-group\">그룹 만들고 관리하기</a></td></tr><tr><td>2 · 그룹원 기본선</td><td><a href=\"#/appendix/group-guide/set-member-permissions\">그룹원 권한 정하기</a></td></tr><tr><td>3 · 커스텀 역할</td><td><a href=\"#/appendix/group-guide/design-custom-roles\">커스텀 역할 설계하기</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"알아두면-좋은-것\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#알아두면-좋은-것\" class=\"peer\">알아두면 좋은 것</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>한 사람이 여러 역할을 가질 수 있고, 권한은 합산됩니다.</strong> 큰 역할 하나보다 작은 역할 여럿이 관리하기 쉽습니다.</li>\n<li><strong>최상위 그룹의 그룹 관리자는 사실상 조직 관리자</strong>로 취급됩니다. 최상위에 그룹 관리자를 둘 때 주의하세요.</li>\n<li>워크스페이스 안에서 할 수 있는 일은 여기와 <strong>별개</strong>입니다. Owner · Editor · Viewer 역할을 따로 따릅니다.</li>\n</ul>"
}